{"id":"n70378-15-8","stage":1,"title":"잡다 · 控制","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70378-15-8-1","ko":"요즘 부동산 경기가 너무 과열되고 있어. 정부 차원의 대책이 필요해.","zh":"最近房地产市场太过火爆了，确实需要政府层面出台对策。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"부동산","meaning":"不动产，房地产","explanation":"부동산：不动产，房地产","readings":[{"term":"부동산","audio":"/audio/94a50d40a977f2418c4e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65843","senseId":"1","lemma":"부동산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부동산","audio":"/audio/94a50d40a977f2418c4e.mp3"}},{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기가","audio":"/audio/1735f3414b564c4d1166.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"과열되고","meaning":"过热，过火","explanation":"과열되다：过热，过火；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"과열되다","audio":"/audio/d181ad4d45c138223c1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18194","senseId":"2","lemma":"과열되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과열되고","audio":"/audio/207fa08c5ec437198c1a.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":